  "details": "When I create a Group+ instance that does not require age verification I try to send join invites to some friends that are not in the group. I am unable to do so. The game tells me they are not group members. \n\nI have been told that people I was trying to invite were unable to join me. I was on green. They asked if I could make my instance a group+ so that they could join us. It already was group+.\n\nI have definitely seen this happen with the following groups for more than 4 weeks now. I waited, as I thought the latest updates would be fixed, but the problem is still there. \n\nSMORES.6634\n\nMMZ.7646\n\nWHIMSY.2660",
